      "result_applied_to": "57797",
      "match_notes": "Roche won the toss and decided to bowl first, Saltash made a good start and continued from there with wickets falling sporadically throughout the innings meaning they finished on 244-5, C Simpson (75), B Eigenmann (53), A Stevenson (38) and M Hutchings (28) with the runs for Saltash, T Trudgeon (2-27) and P Trethewey (2-72) with the wickets.<br>In reply Roche lost 4 wickets early on before a 114 run partnership between M Osbourne (69) and I Trudgeon (42) helped Roche fightback before more wickets fell, meaning they were bowled out for 166 in 39 overs, M Hodge (4-37), D Bolland (3-47) and R Braund (2-50) with the wickets.",
